# ── Rust ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target
**/target/
# Cargo.lock is intentionally committed — this repo contains applications, not libraries.

# ── Node / Next.js ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
.cache/
*.tsbuildinfo
.wrangler/

# ── pnpm / Turborepo ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.turbo/

# ── Environment / secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# Never commit .env — only .env.example is tracked.

# ── OS / editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# ── ML models (large binary files — download via scripts/download_model.sh) ──
**/models/*.onnx
**/models/*-tokenizer.json

# ── Dev-only tooling (reads .env — do not commit) ───────────────────────────
scripts/test_extract_prompt.sh

# ── Local scratch / WIP artifacts (not for the repo) ────────────────────────
# Local dev/test harness (backend launcher, tunnel/proxy logs, Teams app zips).
.dev-test/
# Root-level HTML mockups (e.g. phase2-breakdown, product-state, sources-view).
/*.html
/sample-transcript.txt
# Operator-only prod DB dump (a backup, not source).
scripts/sqlx_migrations.prod.backup.sql
# One-off scratch docs (note: HANDOFF_*/CODE_REVIEW_* are otherwise tracked —
# these two are local-only by choice; remove the line to commit like siblings).
/CODE_REVIEW_BATCH.md
/HANDOFF_WEB_V1.md

# Retrieval eval harness (backend/eval): per-run JSON report and Sonnet-drafted
# golden candidates are local artifacts. The committed source of truth is
# fixtures/corpus.jsonl, golden/golden.jsonl and baseline.json.
backend/eval/last_report.json
backend/eval/last_jev_catalog_scan.json
backend/eval/last_jev_catalog_scale.json
backend/eval/last_jev_catalog_real.json
backend/eval/last_jev_aspects.json
backend/eval/last_jev_onboard.json
backend/eval/last_jev_seats.json
backend/eval/last_jev_leftover.json
backend/eval/last_jev_embed.json
backend/eval/last_jev_topic_first.json
backend/eval/last_jev_ingest_q1_identity.json
backend/eval/last_jev_ingest_q1_relationships.json
backend/eval/last_jev_ingest_q1_claims.json
backend/eval/last_jev_ingest_q1_rel_*.json
backend/eval/hybrid_pick_ids.json
backend/eval/real_catalog_254.json
backend/eval/golden/golden.candidates.jsonl

# Prompt eval harness (backend/eval/PROMPT_EVAL.md): per-run model reports and
# Sonnet-drafted candidate cases are local artifacts. The committed source of
# truth is golden/extraction_golden.json and golden/expertise_golden.json.
backend/eval/reports/
backend/eval/golden/extraction.candidates.json
backend/eval/golden/expertise.candidates.json

# The wayfinder/build-program scratch archive is untracked BY DESIGN (see
# docs/plans/capture/README.md: "untracked, local-only archive"), and it can
# hold full-resolution captures of the founder's live screen (unit 10's OCR
# harness) — a `git add -A` must never be able to commit it.
.scratch/
# Task worktrees checked out inside the repo root (dsp-lift etc.) — never
# stageable from the main checkout.
/worktrees/
# Ad-hoc root-level service logs from local runs (may embed request payloads).
/*.log

# GitHub App private keys (dev + prod) never enter the tree
*.pem
.env.github-prod

# Generated Outlook assets served by the existing web app build.
/web/public/outlook/

# Python bytecode (scripts/ unit tests)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
